                                "sense_id": "00da5998-de5e-381c-a45a-b8f820056068",
                                "text": "Cup conical, weakly developed basal flange, six arms per ray, one exotomous branching, all brachials biserial within two to five brachials of branching, cup ornamentation probably striae radiating from base of arms onto basals."
